          },
          "category": "skill",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Whenever you take a move action to Stride, you can attempt a @Check[acrobatics|dc:15] check to roll forward.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You gain 5 extra feet of movement to your Speeds and can move through solid obstacles such as walls until the end of your Stride action.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> You gain 5 extra feet of movement to your Speeds until the end of your Stride action.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> You lose 5 feet of movement from your Speeds until the end of your Stride action.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> Your character softlocks and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Paralyzed] permanently. Only a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wish] ritual or similar magic can reverse this effect.</p>"
          },
